Z||000000||pherder||06-10-2001||12:35 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p3588e44c47d520624beee3fb6be66b59/fe69f6e8.jpg.orig.jpg"> <P>MrFiero was going to part this car out but offered it to me.  Engine was trashed (daughter of PO didn't understand what oil does or doesn't do if there isn't enough!)<P>Using 3 different engines to make one and a lot of little things (that add up!), I got it insured, licensed, and tagged Friday.<P>Put on my 16" wheels to see what it looked like and drove it around today for the first time!<P>Still need to put a windshield in it and charge the A/C but everything else works on it ... including the cruise control!<P>Paul<p>[This message has been edited by pherder (edited 06-10-2001).]||||reg||6
